<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA-PAKISTAN SECOND TEST ENDS IN DRAW.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA-PAKISTAN SECOND TEST ENDS IN DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The second and final test between Sri Lanka and Pakistan ended in a draw on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 331 and 386-4 declared; Pakistan 292 and 285-5.</p>
</text>
